   "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.78,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I've got about two hundred DVDs in the loft. Worth keeping?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "block": "movies.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Depends. Some films vanish from streaming, and a disc means you always have them. Others you'll never watch again.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ngozi, could you mute yourself? Your keyboard's really loud.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 2.43,
   "block": "nq_work_021",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_work_021",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Ngozi"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "other",
   "text": "Oops, sorry.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "block": "nq_work_021"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I barely have a DVD player anymore.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.49,
   "block": "movies.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then keep the ones you love or can't easily stream, and donate the rest. Charity shops and libraries often take them.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Some are",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "movies.dlg29"
  },
  {
